; [0.8.1-RT14] (#954), work #955: the tag of -ATTDEF (card PT14, point 2; docs/adr/0056,
; point 2). An empty tag gives "Tag cannot be null." and the question repeats, as AutoCAD
; in the session of 2026-11-22. The tag question is a PromptKind::Name (#1052): at level 2
; a space is Enter, so a tag line with a space would give different reports at the two
; levels (docs/verifica/script.md, "Lo spazio al livello 2"); the unit tests of PT14 fix
; "Invalid tag name." for a line with a space at level 1. Prompt and default keep their
; spaces, as NOTA of autocad-attributi.
; Source: Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit 2aafbb1fa17abc67fdf2ff7de26a34b70e79b736
